--- !u!114 &1747882410
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1747882408}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b62134dab38776c42951df356e3588ca, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: HiddenHarbours.World::HiddenHarbours.World.RoutineStations
  _stations:
  - Id: station.st_peters.green_a
    Position: {x: 1.1815614, y: 6.529129}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 60.94276
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: green
    Why: "standing on the green, place 1 of 4 \u2014 the ground between the hearth
      and the spawn, where the life is"
  - Id: station.st_peters.green_b
    Position: {x: 2.5, y: 7}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 180
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: green
    Why: "standing on the green, place 2 of 4 \u2014 the ground between the hearth
      and the spawn, where the life is"
  - Id: station.st_peters.green_c
    Position: {x: 3.8184385, y: 7.470871}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -119.05725
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: green
    Why: "standing on the green, place 3 of 4 \u2014 the ground between the hearth
      and the spawn, where the life is"
  - Id: station.st_peters.green_d
    Position: {x: 5.136877, y: 7.941742}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -119.05725
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: green
    Why: "standing on the green, place 4 of 4 \u2014 the ground between the hearth
      and the spawn, where the life is"
  - Id: station.st_peters.ginny_village_mark
    Position: {x: 4, y: 11}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 180
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: yard_cottage
    Why: "Ginny's mark in the village \u2014 the spot the opening's first conversation
      happens on, and where she is through the working day now that she lives out
      on her plot"
  - Id: station.st_peters.cottage_step
    Position: {x: 76.73723, y: 26.12861}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -111.84395
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: yard_ginny_plot
    Why: "Ginny's own step, out on her plot in the eastern woods \u2014 turned to
      look back down the way you walk up from the village"
  - Id: station.st_peters.cottage_garden
    Position: {x: 84, y: 21}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 0
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: yard_ginny_plot
    Why: "the garden on the cottage's south side \u2014 the sunny flank, and the
      one clear of both the door and the sheds now that she gardens her own ground"
  - Id: station.st_peters.saltbox_dooryard
    Position: {x: 17.507397, y: 7.6669955}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -93.95532
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: yard_saltbox
    Why: the red saltbox's own dooryard, the green's east side
  - Id: station.st_peters.farmhouse_dooryard
    Position: {x: 15.767875, y: 20.626465}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -147.9587
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: lane_farmhouse
    Why: the white farmhouse's dooryard, closing the lane's east end
  - Id: station.st_peters.sage_dooryard
    Position: {x: 7.992671, y: -12.773616}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -10.123598
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: yard_sage_cottage
    Why: "the sage cottage's dooryard \u2014 the last house before the shore"
  - Id: station.st_peters.store_counter
    Position: {x: 3.532163, y: 23.514606}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -177.69942
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: lane_store
    Why: "behind the store counter \u2014 the storekeeper's own doorstep, unmoved"
  - Id: station.st_peters.store_customer_a
    Position: {x: 2.446781, y: 20.576588}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 13.358199
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: lane_store
    Why: customer slot 1 at the store counter, a stride the near side of it
  - Id: station.st_peters.store_customer_b
    Position: {x: 3.3450282, y: 20.520447}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 2.3005733
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: lane_store
    Why: customer slot 2 at the store counter, a stride the near side of it
  - Id: station.st_peters.store_customer_c
    Position: {x: 4.2432756, y: 20.464306}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -8.522487
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: lane_store
    Why: customer slot 3 at the store counter, a stride the near side of it
  - Id: station.st_peters.post_office_door
    Position: {x: 12.539912, y: 35.914948}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 12.581645
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: lane_post_office
    Why: "the post office's own doorstep \u2014 where you hand in the day's mail"
  - Id: station.st_peters.flats_head
    Position: {x: -55, y: 2.5}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 270
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: flats_head
    Why: "the head of the flats, a few strides off the wet bucket \u2014 where a
      man who digs for a living stands, looking west out over the bar (#354's own
      spot, unmoved)"
  - Id: station.st_peters.flats_lookout
    Position: {x: -52.009144, y: 2.734067}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 270
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: flats_head
    Why: "a few strides inland of the digging, looking west \u2014 the sun goes down
      over the bar, and this is the only place on the island you can watch it do
      that"
  - Id: station.st_peters.slip_head
    Position: {x: 190, y: 0}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 82.40455
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: slip_head
    Why: "the shoreward end of the slip, on the planks \u2014 where a boat's line
      gets taken"
  - Id: station.st_peters.wharf_head
    Position: {x: 207.5, y: 1.5}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 90
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: wharf_head
    Why: "up the wharf from the slip head, watching the water (#354's own spot, unmoved)
      \u2014 the dock is the east end, so this is who is there when you come home
      under power"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_saltbox
    Position: {x: 21.86, y: 8}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 90
    Interior: {fileID: 353585568}
    LaneNodeName: yard_saltbox
    Why: "the saltbox's keeping room \u2014 Rose's"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_farmhouse
    Position: {x: 18.334208, y: 24.286463}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 44.999985
    Interior: {fileID: 1673921368}
    LaneNodeName: lane_farmhouse
    Why: "the farmhouse hall \u2014 the biggest floor on the island, and the only
      one that seats four"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_sage_a
    Position: {x: 10.6, y: -18.184126}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 153.43494
    Interior: {fileID: 1378592703}
    LaneNodeName: yard_sage_cottage
    Why: "the fisherman's cottage, one side of the doorway lane \u2014 Junior's"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_sage_b
    Position: {x: 9.400001, y: -18.184126}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -153.43497
    Interior: {fileID: 1378592703}
    LaneNodeName: yard_sage_cottage
    Why: "the same cottage, the other side \u2014 Basil's. Two men of the water under
      one roof, and two people leaving one door at dawn is a thing you can watch
      happen"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_store
    Position: {x: 3.9999998, y: 28.557407}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 0.000011383649
    Interior: {fileID: 84642749}
    LaneNodeName: lane_store
    Why: "the store's own floor \u2014 the storekeeper lives over her shop, which
      is why the shop is dark at night by the same data that draws her asleep"
  - Id: station.st_peters.school_desk
    Position: {x: -12, y: 31.31911}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 0
    Interior: {fileID: 816773077}
    LaneNodeName: lane_school
    Why: "the schoolroom \u2014 the teacher's desk at the stove end, facing back
      down the room"
  - Id: station.st_peters.post_office_counter
    Position: {x: 16.68, y: 41.039497}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 0
    Interior: {fileID: 729072594}
    LaneNodeName: lane_post_office
    Why: "behind the post office counter. \u26A0\uFE0F Its street door is on the
      OPPOSITE wall to a house's and 1.68 m off its centre, both MEASURED \u2014
      see InsideStandPoint"
